  <div class="service-fold">
<article>
<header class="hero"><div class="wrap">
<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true"> / </span><a href="/services">Services</a><span aria-hidden="true"> / </span><span>Data and Analytics Project Management</span></nav>

<h1 class="page-title">Data and Analytics Project Management</h1>
<p class="lede">Analytics projects stall when no one owns the decisions. We run yours from kickoff to a report the business actually uses.</p>
</div></header>
<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
<h2>The build looks done, but finance still opens the old file</h2>
<p>Scope drifts after kickoff. No one owns refresh or access. Training is a slide deck that arrives too late. So finance keeps the spreadsheet.</p>
</div></section>
