<section class="band"><div class="wrap">
<h2>What we own until it is adopted</h2>
<div class="cards-2">
<article class="card"><h3>Scope</h3><p>Tied to the decisions the report must support. New requests join only when they change one.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Owners</h3><p>A named owner for the project, for keeping the report current, and for access.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>The calendar</h3><p>A visible timeline, including when people hear what changed.</p></article>
<article class="card"><h3>Training</h3><p>Hands-on, on the real report, before the meeting that needs it. Then we confirm people can use it.</p></article>
</div>
</div></section>
